{"4057050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Heroines Through My Lens", "steam_appid": 4057050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/626569ece841c944f5d10f562d2fd232.poster.avif?t=1787101636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/626569ece841c944f5d10f562d2fd232.webm?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/626569ece841c944f5d10f562d2fd232.mp4?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“OMG!!!!! Who did this?!”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Utter chaos. Everything’s a disaster!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/317ff72d635ac6b351a7bc8cd5db8ba6.poster.avif?t=1787101636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/317ff72d635ac6b351a7bc8cd5db8ba6.webm?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/317ff72d635ac6b351a7bc8cd5db8ba6.mp4?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As if being a nepotism hire wasn’t bad enough—you accidentally walk in on a senior changing, bump into your manager’s butt,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>and now you’ve messed up an important project, too?!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>After losing your friends, your job, and your money chasing your fashion dreams,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>you can’t afford to fail again!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Raise your reputation, nail every shoot, and survive this wild workplace!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/2a7099dc1f187ccb7f6168ed42a926b9.poster.avif?t=1787101636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/2a7099dc1f187ccb7f6168ed42a926b9.webm?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/2a7099dc1f187ccb7f6168ed42a926b9.mp4?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“From an otaku’s perspective, this outfit would totally blow up online!”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One word from you and the mood begins to change.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Maybe success isn’t that far off after all?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Earn affection, take the perfect photos, and collect beautiful shots!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Whether you focus on career or romance, your choices decide your future.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Now, it’s time to begin your first day at Lazaworks! 🎥</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heroines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/0512eafc7d77189fc986d77b824482e8.poster.avif?t=1787101636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/0512eafc7d77189fc986d77b824482e8.webm?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/0512eafc7d77189fc986d77b824482e8.mp4?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Joo Ah-reum — Influencer / Sharp-Tongued Diva</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“I’m the influencer Joo Ah-reum. Do I really have to do this?”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stunning content creator with half a million followers and an ego to match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She’ll drive you crazy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But behind her pride, there’s a surprisingly pure heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/7682330c9c6b4fec023850fec82eeac4.poster.avif?t=1787101636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/7682330c9c6b4fec023850fec82eeac4.webm?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/7682330c9c6b4fec023850fec82eeac4.mp4?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sung Jun-hee — Marketing Manager / Fierce Workaholic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“I don’t fall for new hire. If I don’t like someone, I fire them.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charismatic perfectionist known for her stellar work ethic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re assigned to photograph her — will you make it out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumor has it she has a soft spot for men who get the job done…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/68033064c6401fbd38543735d8b1c53a.poster.avif?t=1787101636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/68033064c6401fbd38543735d8b1c53a.webm?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/68033064c6401fbd38543735d8b1c53a.mp4?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mina Suzuki — Lookbook YouTuber / Sultry Model</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“Jiwoo, you’re like a K-drama lead! So cool!”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A top YouTuber who owns the camera with her charm and confidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet and bubbly on set, but fierce when facing her rival, Ju Ahreum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One compliment from you, though… and she turns bright red.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/1025eff6fb01692525d3e6d3c6260920.poster.avif?t=1787101636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/1025eff6fb01692525d3e6d3c6260920.webm?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/1025eff6fb01692525d3e6d3c6260920.mp4?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kang Hye-won — Design Senior / Your First Love</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“Jiwoo, you’d fit perfectly on our team. Want to transfer?”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your college senior and first love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes she appears in daring outfits, asking teasing questions… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Could this be the spark that reignites your past feelings?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/416307c21c9c0f65e3769b6fe3f109d5.poster.avif?t=1787101636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/416307c21c9c0f65e3769b6fe3f109d5.webm?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/416307c21c9c0f65e3769b6fe3f109d5.mp4?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Park Ji-young — HR Intern / Adorable Vlogger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“Oppa still treats me like a kid, but I’m an adult now!”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute and approachable, but not afraid to flex her HR authority when she needs to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She’s your clingy yet clumsy best friend...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but can you really trust her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five women, each with their own unique charm, secrets, and stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will you fall for — or will your heart choose someone else entirely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Immersive First-Person Romance Simulation</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the entire story through Jiwoo Kim’s eyes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact, choose, and navigate realistic workplace moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision you make shapes relationships, tension, and outcomes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📸 FMV Lookbook Photography Gameplay</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not just watching — you’re the photographer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play interactive mini-games to capture stunning shots of the heroines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your photos unlock bonus videos, CGs, and exclusive lookbook collections.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💖 Diverse Heroines, Dynamic Choices</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From seniors to influencers, every heroine reacts to your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each has her own route, secrets, and personality —</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >giving you multiple ways to fall in love (or get in trouble).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔑 Multiple Endings &amp; Collections</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather lookbooks, unlock bonus videos, and replay routes to uncover hidden endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made a mistake? Don’t worry — try again and craft your own perfect story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re Storytaco, an interactive game development studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project marks our first collaboration with WHYNOT Media,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and we’re beyond thrilled to bring you this brand-new FMV experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to your amazing support for our previous FMV series,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we were able to take storytelling and immersion to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, we’ve focused on the detailed world of lookbook production — <br>a vivid and realistic workplace where your choices truly matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We poured our hearts into every scene to meet your expectations, imagination, and desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please continue to share your love and feedback —</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we’ll keep growing and creating the stories you want to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you, and enjoy your first day at Lazaworks! 💼✨</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/626569ece841c944f5d10f562d2fd232.poster.avif?t=1787101636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/626569ece841c944f5d10f562d2fd232.webm?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/626569ece841c944f5d10f562d2fd232.mp4?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“OMG!!!!! Who did this?!”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Utter chaos. Everything’s a disaster!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><