class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/7682330c9c6b4fec023850fec82eeac4.poster.avif?t=1787101636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/7682330c9c6b4fec023850fec82eeac4.webm?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/7682330c9c6b4fec023850fec82eeac4.mp4?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sung Jun-hee — Marketing Manager / Fierce Workaholic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“I don’t fall for new hire. If I don’t like someone, I fire them.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charismatic perfectionist known for her stellar work ethic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re assigned to photograph her — will you make it out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumor has it she has a soft spot for men who get the job done…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/68033064c6401fbd38543735d8b1c53a.poster.avif?t=1787101636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/68033064c6401fbd38543735d8b1c53a.webm?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/68033064c6401fbd38543735d8b1c53a.mp4?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mina Suzuki — Lookbook YouTuber / Sultry Model</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“Jiwoo, you’re like a K-drama lead! So cool!”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A top YouTuber who owns the camera with her charm and confidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet and bubbly on set, but fierce when facing her rival, Ju Ahreum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One compliment from you, though… and she turns bright red.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/1025eff6fb01692525d3e6d3c6260920.poster.avif?t=1787101636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/1025eff6fb01692525d3e6d3c6260920.webm?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/1025eff6fb01692525d3e6d3c6260920.mp4?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kang Hye-won — Design Senior / Your First Love</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“Jiwoo, you’d fit perfectly on our team. Want to transfer?”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your college senior and first love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes she appears in daring outfits, asking teasing questions… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Could this be the spark that reignites your past feelings?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/416307c21c9c0f65e3769b6fe3f109d5.poster.avif?t=1787101636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/416307c21c9c0f65e3769b6fe3f109d5.webm?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/extras/416307c21c9c0f65e3769b6fe3f109d5.mp4?t=1787101636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Park Ji-young — HR Intern / Adorable Vlogger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“Oppa still treats me like a kid, but I’m an adult now!”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute and approachable, but not afraid to flex her HR authority when she needs to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She’s your clingy yet clumsy best friend...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but can you really trust her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five women, each with their own unique charm, secrets, and stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will you fall for — or will your heart choose someone else entirely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Immersive First-Person Romance Simulation</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the entire story through Jiwoo Kim’s eyes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact, choose, and navigate realistic workplace moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision you make shapes relationships, tension, and outcomes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📸 FMV Lookbook Photography Gameplay</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not just watching — you’re the photographer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play interactive mini-games to capture stunning shots of the heroines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your photos unlock bonus videos, CGs, and exclusive lookbook collections.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💖 Diverse Heroines, Dynamic Choices</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From seniors to influencers, every heroine reacts to your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each has her own route, secrets, and personality —</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >giving you multiple ways to fall in love (or get in trouble).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔑 Multiple Endings &amp; Collections</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather lookbooks, unlock bonus videos, and replay routes to uncover hidden endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made a mistake? Don’t worry — try again and craft your own perfect story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re Storytaco, an interactive game development studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project marks our first collaboration with WHYNOT Media,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and we’re beyond thrilled to bring you this brand-new FMV experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to your amazing support for our previous FMV series,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we were able to take storytelling and immersion to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, we’ve focused on the detailed world of lookbook production — <br>a vivid and realistic workplace where your choices truly matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We poured our hearts into every scene to meet your expectations, imagination, and desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please continue to share your love and feedback —</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we’ll keep growing and creating the stories you want to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you, and enjoy your first day at Lazaworks! 💼✨</p>", "short_description": "“Me? A lookbook shoot?!” New hire Kim Jiwoo joins YouTube studio Lazaworks and gets thrown into photographing top youtubers and his own bosses on day one. Under the bright lights, stolen glances turn into secret favors and forbidden romances. The more you shoot, the more hearts stolen.", "supported_languages": "English, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America, Indonesian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/1b7418eef308fdf157f77c7c92dada8844da121f/header.jpg?t=1787101636", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/28100af0465557ba2e7cc997a69e4266c5676934/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787101636", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057050/28100af0465557ba2e7cc997a69e4266c5676934/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787101636", "website": "https://storytaco.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Discrete graphics card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or AMD equivalent or above<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Discrete graphics card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_require